From e3eb2a03443f4d4868103c718a0000761dcbe09f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:03:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat; Add `kvm.SetMouseInput` tool to control the pointer in the target via the KVM with MCP enums

Signed-off-by: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
---
diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index fcb7f06b093a5b25c6ffe9ca9df682d1f1d6daec..d7b98b8ed79e958c0f2db51a231c44300c5b475c 100644
